{"product_id":"smok-rpm-4-60w-pod-system","title":"SMOK RPM 4 60W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the SMOK RPM 4 60W Pod System, featuring an integrated 1650mAh battery, 5-60W output, and two different pods to accept RPM or LP2 Coils.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Links:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSMOK RPM 4 Replacement Pods\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-rpm-series-replacement-coils\" title=\"SMOK RPM replacement coils\"\u003eSMOK RPM Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-lp2-replacement-coils\" title=\"SMOK LP2 replacement coils\"\u003eSMOK LP2 Replacement Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOutfitted with an integrated 1650mAh battery, the RPM 4 Pod System can deliver up to 60W output with relative ease. Charging via Type-C USB Cable, the SMOK RPM 4 is portable and perfect for anyone on-the-go and delivers satisfying vapor from either the RPM or LP2 Coil Series when used in their respective pods. Constructed from durable zinc-alloy, the chassis of the RPM 4 Pod System can protect against light falls and drops and features an airflow control switch for MTL or RDL output.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK RPM 4 60W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 103mm by 27.9mm by 25mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1650mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 5-60W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoltage Output Range: 0.8-4.0V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.2-2.5ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntuitive Firing Button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.96\" TFT Display Screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTwo Adjustment Buttons\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStepless Airflow Control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e5mL Pod Capacity - RPM \u0026amp; LP2 Options\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSMOK LP2 Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.23ohm LP2 Meshed DL Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSMOK RPM Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.4ohm RPM Mesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in Black, Pale Champagne, Rose Gold, Silver Red, Silver Blue, Cyan Pink, Black Leather, Red Leather, Blue Leather, and Brown Leather\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41673692708919,"sku":"69d25f6f49d1f","price":5400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_rpm_4_screen.png?v=1747875601","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-rpm-4-60w-pod-system","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




